      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766238018000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Sarah. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766238026266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to start a return for an order.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 78876,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766238030866666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help you with that. Do you have your order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766238033599999
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it's VF-8675309.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 78876,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766238038599999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. Let me just pull that up... Okay, I see the order for the Urban Commuter Helmet. To get started, could you tell me a bit more about the issue? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766238040199999
    },
    {
      "text": "It was a gift, and the color is wrong. I just need to return it. The box is unopened.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 78876,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766238053866665
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. I see here the delivery date was about 53 days ago. Let me just double-check our current return policy for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766238059733331
    },
    {
      "text": "Look, is it a yes or a no? I don't have all day.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 78876,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766238068266664
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, I can approve that. I'm looking at our policy now, and it confirms that for a standard item like this helmet, you have a 90-day window for returns. You're well within that timeframe.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766238071666664
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay. Good. What's next?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 78876,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766238084333330
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. We want to ensure you're happy with your gear and your safety is paramount. Since the box is unopened, I've just initiated the return and sent a prepaid shipping label to the email address on file. Just print it out and attach it to the package.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766238086133330
    },
    {
      "text": "Got the email. That's all I needed. Thanks.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 78876,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766238103399996
    },
    {
      "text": "You're very welcome. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
